{
  "name": "半年托",
  "status": "structured",
  "timeframe": "1d",
  "source_pages": [783, 784, 785],
  "source": "半年托是20、60、120日均线交叉形成的三角托举结构，通常意味着在月托、季托之后进一步完成的中期底部转强；若再伴随平台突破、强势K线组合和较好的市场环境，则理论上有较长上涨周期。",
  "source_summary": "若20/60/120日均线形成向上托举，并配合价格突破近期平台，可视为半年托成立。",
  "comment": "当前先提取日线版‘20/60/120三线托举 + 平台突破’主干，不引入L3能量与分时回档买点。",
  "computable_from_daily_ocvhl": true,
  "required_fields": ["close", "volume"],
  "warmup_bars": 200,
  "indicator_type": "trend_rule",
  "params": {
    "ma_fast_window": 20,
    "ma_mid_window": 60,
    "ma_slow_window": 120,
    "sequence_lookback": 60,
    "breakout_lookback": 40,
    "volume_ma_window": 10,
    "signal_keep_days": 8,
    "allow_same_day": true
  },
  "series": [
    {
      "id": "ma_20",
      "op": "sma",
      "field": "close",
      "window": "$params.ma_fast_window",
      "description": "20日均线"
    },
    {
      "id": "ma_60",
      "op": "sma",
      "field": "close",
      "window": "$params.ma_mid_window",
      "description": "60日均线"
    },
    {
      "id": "ma_120",
      "op": "sma",
      "field": "close",
      "window": "$params.ma_slow_window",
      "description": "120日均线"
    },
    {
      "id": "platform_high",
      "op": "highest",
      "field": "close",
      "window": "$params.breakout_lookback",
      "description": "近期平台或头部压力位近似"
    },
    {
      "id": "platform_high_prev",
      "op": "ref",
      "field": "platform_high",
      "window": 1,
      "description": "前一日平台高点"
    },
    {
      "id": "volume_ma",
      "op": "sma",
      "field": "volume",
      "window": "$params.volume_ma_window",
      "description": "10日均量"
    }
  ],
  "events": [
    {
      "id": "cross_20_60_up",
      "op": "cross_up",
      "left": "ma_20",
      "right": "ma_60",
      "description": "20日均线上穿60日均线"
    },
    {
      "id": "cross_20_120_up",
      "op": "cross_up",
      "left": "ma_20",
      "right": "ma_120",
      "description": "20日均线上穿120日均线"
    },
    {
      "id": "cross_60_120_up",
      "op": "cross_up",
      "left": "ma_60",
      "right": "ma_120",
      "description": "60日均线上穿120日均线"
    },
    {
      "id": "breakout_platform",
      "op": "breakout_up",
      "left": "close",
      "right": "platform_high_prev",
      "description": "突破近期平台压力位"
    }
  ],
  "rules": {
    "latest_match": {
      "op": "within",
      "window": "$params.signal_keep_days",
      "condition": {
        "op": "and",
        "conditions": [
          {
            "op": "sequence",
            "window": "$params.sequence_lookback",
            "allow_same_day": "$params.allow_same_day",
            "conditions": [
              {
                "op": "condition",
                "event": "cross_20_60_up"
              },
              {
                "op": "condition",
                "event": "cross_20_120_up"
              },
              {
                "op": "condition",
                "event": "cross_60_120_up"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "op": "condition",
            "event": "breakout_platform"
          },
          {
            "op": "compare",
            "left": "volume",
            "operator": ">",
            "right": "volume_ma"
          },
          {
            "op": "compare",
            "left": "ma_20",
            "operator": ">=",
            "right": "ma_60"
          },
          {
            "op": "compare",
            "left": "ma_60",
            "operator": ">=",
            "right": "ma_120"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "calculation_steps": [
    "计算20、60、120日均线，并识别三条均线的向上交叉序列。",
    "要求在sequence_lookback窗口内完成20/60/120三线托举，近似半年托形成。",
    "以放量突破近期平台高点作为半年托成立后的买入确认。"
  ],
  "signal_day_definition": "以半年托形成后放量突破平台的当日作为半年托确认日。",
  "manual_review_needed": [
    "原文还结合OBV通气、两阳夹一阴、多方炮和指数环境，当前未纳入这些增强条件。"
  ],
  "implementation_notes": [
    "warmup_bars >= ma_slow_window + sequence_lookback + 1。"
  ],
  "explain": "半年托被结构化为20/60/120三线托举完成后，价格放量突破平台的中期转强信号。"
}
